description	"K-2SO

An exceptionally sturdy tank with protection against multiple Force powers and damage types. Deals massive knockback.

^2Weaponry:
- Terminating Melee
-- 100% more damage
-- 150% more knockback
-- Heavyweight
-- Grab/slap only
- Droid Spankers (Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Staggers/trips on hit
-- 165% more knockback
-- 5% faster movement
-- 100% more special damage
-- 35% shorter
-- 300% thicker
- SE-14r Light Repeating Blaster (A280 2)
-- 15% more FP drain
-- 45% slower RoF
-- Mag reload

^5Powers:
- Droid Rage (3) ^3[CS1/4]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
- Strength (3)
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Armor Regen (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- 10% more knockback given
- 80% less knockback taken"